#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:5 1c0c83d295974b538700a7bf7f8f0bff
msgid "Introduction to Sub"
msgstr "水下机器人（Sub）简介"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:7 4e68cfc4156e4bc6b7a984e5102222cc
msgid ""
"Sub is an advanced open-source autopilot system for submersible ROVs (Remote"
" Operated Vehicle) that supports multiple vehicle configurations. It offers "
"a variety of operating modes from fully manual to fully autonomous."
msgstr "Sub 是一款先进的开源自动驾驶系统，适用于潜水式水下机器人（ROV），支持多种飞行器配置，提供从完全手动到完全自主的多种操作模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:14 761c86779b0f4b6ca5c81a8b2030d948
msgid "Vehicle Configuration Options"
msgstr "飞行器配置选项"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:16 906e19d75eb84e99b31647e20d1edff5
msgid ""
"Sub supports both brushed and brushless, uni-directional or bi-directional "
"propulsion motors/thrusters"
msgstr "Sub 支持有刷和无刷、单向或双向推进电机/推进器"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:17 403c04d7877b4687baba4bbb01cbf6b1
msgid ""
"3/4/5/6 or 8 thruster configurations controlling up to all 6 degrees of "
"vehicular motion and axial rotation"
msgstr "3/4/5/6 或 8 推进器配置，可控制最多全部 6 个自由度的运动和轴向旋转"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:18 43da420b7bb44cad98d05a303f27948f
msgid ""
"Pilot control and telemetry via cable tether to a Ground Control Station "
"(GCS) using joystick, button, and/or keyboard commands, or"
msgstr "通过脐带缆连接地面控制站（GCS），使用摇杆、按钮和/或键盘命令进行飞手控制和遥测，或"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:19 76624122c5c945ca88e537942eafc6ba
msgid "Pilot control and telemetry via radio control to tethered surface buoy"
msgstr "通过无线电控制与有缆水面浮标进行飞手控制和遥测"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:20 3d6292ec14c747d78b91bac00338292c
msgid ""
"Position and Depth Control using optional depth sensor, GPS while surfaced, "
"Sonars, or Shore/Support Vessel based acoustic beacon locators"
msgstr "位置与深度控制：可选深度传感器、水面时的 GPS、声呐，或岸基/支持船声学信标定位器"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:21 3c8da27e86f64e9d90ac27f638ff6959
msgid ""
"Leak, Temperature, and internal Pressure sensor options for vehicle safety"
msgstr "进水、温度和内部气压传感器选项，用于飞行器安全保护"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:22 abe566b70ac34ab8957d0c311d27e92e
msgid ""
"Ethernet vehicle peripheral connectivity option for sophisticated sensors "
"like Side Scan sonars"
msgstr "以太网飞行器外设连接选项，适用于侧扫声呐等精密传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:23 6bda2fd39fda4bbb9b7332517d98b51d
msgid "100's of ArduPilot compatible autopilots to choose from"
msgstr "数百款兼容 ArduPilot 的自动驾驶仪可供选择"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:24 73effb404d484b31991142e292a007d0
msgid ""
"Optional Linux based companion computer interface to autopilot for image "
"processing, beacon data processing, sonar displays in the GCS, custom "
"applications, etc."
msgstr "可选基于 Linux 的伴侣计算机与自动驾驶仪接口，用于图像处理、信标数据处理、地面站声呐显示、自定义应用等"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:25 733a51a8e85a4102841dc16e0b55e071
msgid "Analog and Digital Video camera and OSD (On Screen Display) support"
msgstr "支持模拟和数字摄像头及 OSD（屏幕显示）"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:26 790629b3b7f940b9b9ca2a041b938214
msgid ""
"Optional Buoyancy Control instead of vertical thrusters/neutral buoyancy"
msgstr "可选浮力控制，替代垂直推进器/中性浮力方案"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:27 03866cfacadf455a9f4806b56d236651
msgid "Optional Grabber for object retrieval or manipulation"
msgstr "可选机械抓手，用于物体取回或操作"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:31 cc16467f14bd48fea69a8366545c8414
msgid "Swim Features"
msgstr "游泳（水下运动）功能"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:33 d29038dd1e944283a4be30a89181600b
msgid ""
"Automatic Attitude Stabilization, Depth Control, Position Control (assuming "
"configuration and installed sensors allow it)"
msgstr "自动姿态稳定、深度控制、位置控制（前提是配置和已安装的传感器允许）"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:34 f701afd6c5f84f1890c4a03eb6c2aaa9
msgid "Fully Autonomous Missions, see :ref:`common-mission-planning`"
msgstr "完全自主任务，参见 :ref:`common-mission-planning`"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:35 0d356a7eb0414a5a8fb59f40d83fcf6e
msgid ""
"Configurable Failsafes for system component failures, see :ref:`failsafe-"
"landing-page`"
msgstr "可配置的系统组件故障保护，参见 :ref:`failsafe-landing-page`"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:36 f9ae85b63bd04f68a59339d43b100b1f
msgid "Subsurface Terrain Following and Surface Tracking, see :ref:`modes`"
msgstr "水下地形跟随和水面跟踪，参见 :ref:`modes`"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:37 6a69191def7f4de8afa3f5d310660567
msgid "Extensive GCS Button Action Support, see :ref:`buttons`"
msgstr "丰富的地面站按钮动作支持，参见 :ref:`buttons`"
